WEBVTT

1
00:00:13.013 --> 00:00:14.014
I go to school.

2
00:00:24.524 --> 00:00:25.692
<i>I was 19.</i>

3
00:00:26.818 --> 00:00:28.987
<i>And even when the heart was still fickle,</i>

4
00:00:30.405 --> 00:00:32.699
<i>I was devoted to my first love.</i>

5
00:00:36.953 --> 00:00:39.205
<i>There were two types of people for me.</i>

6
00:00:43.209 --> 00:00:44.377
<i>Hong Si Chun</i>

7
00:00:45.628 --> 00:00:46.921
<i>and all the rest.</i>

8
00:00:47.464 --> 00:00:48.298
Honsey!

9
00:00:55.722 --> 00:00:58.767
<i>And as in childhood, when I first tasted</i>
<i>a sweet carbonated drink,</i>

10
00:00:59.517 --> 00:01:02.103
<i>stars twinkled in his eyes,</i>
<i>when I looked at him.</i>

11
00:01:07.901 --> 00:01:10.737
No need. This umbrella
not enough for two.

12
00:01:10.820 --> 00:01:12.489
You will get wet from the rain.

13
00:01:12.572 --> 00:01:13.990
That would be cool.

14
00:01:14.741 --> 00:01:17.327
Real artists are bald
or with long hair.

15
00:01:18.161 --> 00:01:18.995
hold on

16
00:01:22.165 --> 00:01:24.334
<i>That's what Hong Si Chun was to me.</i>

17
00:01:26.127 --> 00:01:28.963
<i>For the one who listened</i>
<i>only the best 100 songs…</i>

18
00:01:30.048 --> 00:01:31.633
Is there a concert album?

19
00:01:31.716 --> 00:01:34.135
This? This is an unofficial record.

20
00:01:34.219 --> 00:01:36.137
You always say wait.

21
00:01:37.430 --> 00:01:41.684
<i>…Si Chun's musical taste was sparkling,</i>
<i>like a diamond in the rough.</i>

22
00:01:42.352 --> 00:01:44.062
Does it hurt a lot?

23
00:01:44.145 --> 00:01:45.980
Is it possible to do this with your own son?

24
00:01:46.773 --> 00:01:49.943
But I left there forever.
Great feeling.

25
00:01:50.026 --> 00:01:52.153
Now I can play music freely.

26
00:01:53.988 --> 00:01:56.324
<i>And the one who never had a dream...</i>

27
00:01:56.825 --> 00:01:59.744
The world is scary. Living alone is not easy.

28
00:01:59.828 --> 00:02:01.121
You're with me, right?

29
00:02:05.625 --> 00:02:08.211
OK. I will take care of you.

30
00:02:10.463 --> 00:02:13.258
<i>…he gave a chance to love the dreamer.</i>

31
00:02:13.341 --> 00:02:14.175
graze

32
00:02:14.884 --> 00:02:16.302
Goal!

33
00:02:23.852 --> 00:02:25.937
It's a little late, but do you want to come with me?

34
00:02:29.774 --> 00:02:32.443
<i>Our hearts were full of happiness.</i>

35
00:02:38.533 --> 00:02:40.618
Maybe I'll try like you.

36
00:02:41.786 --> 00:02:44.289
I worry that my life has no meaning.

37
00:02:44.372 --> 00:02:46.499
There must be something I like.

38
00:02:49.127 --> 00:02:52.213
What did you bring today? I'm hungry

39
00:02:53.840 --> 00:02:57.552
<i>And I always succeeded</i>
<i>push feelings of anxiety away.</i>

40
00:02:58.052 --> 00:03:00.430
Yes, yes. Fried squid, your favorite.

41
00:03:00.513 --> 00:03:01.514
How are you?

42
00:03:07.437 --> 00:03:09.731
FILM SCRIPT COMPETITION

43
00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:28.541
And how? Do I look presentable?

44
00:03:30.501 --> 00:03:31.920
And what? are you nervous

45
00:03:34.088 --> 00:03:36.424
Why is my Xi Chun nervous?

46
00:03:36.507 --> 00:03:38.343
I am meeting them for the first time.

47
00:03:38.426 --> 00:03:40.595
Go and be yourself.

48
00:03:40.678 --> 00:03:42.680
Your music will convince them.

49
00:03:43.389 --> 00:03:44.307
Good luck

50
00:03:51.731 --> 00:03:53.107
I can't Chu A.

51
00:03:55.026 --> 00:03:56.027
Come with me.

52
00:03:56.110 --> 00:03:56.945
What?

53
00:03:58.947 --> 00:04:00.782
I would gladly

54
00:04:02.283 --> 00:04:03.618
but I can't

55
00:04:03.701 --> 00:04:04.953
Please.

56
00:04:05.536 --> 00:04:07.538
I will not say a word without you.

57
00:04:08.873 --> 00:04:11.209
But I have to finish the script today.

58
00:04:21.427 --> 00:04:24.722
OK. I will go with you.
I'll just take the bag.

59
00:04:26.641 --> 00:04:27.475
Thank you.

60
00:04:28.101 --> 00:04:32.355
<i>And after many years I finally understood</i>

61
00:04:33.147 --> 00:04:35.108
<i>what's even in this tiny room</i>

62
00:04:35.775 --> 00:04:39.570
<i>there was Hong Si Chun and all the rest.</i>

63
00:04:42.198 --> 00:04:43.116
Everything.

64
00:04:44.242 --> 00:04:47.453
<i>Probably, he always will be</i>
<i>the greatest love of my life.</i>

65
00:04:47.537 --> 00:04:49.789
That's it. OK.

66
00:04:52.375 --> 00:04:53.209
Si Chun.

67
00:04:54.043 --> 00:04:54.877
What?

68
00:04:56.296 --> 00:04:57.714
We should go our separate ways.

69
00:04:58.798 --> 00:05:00.967
<i>But the thought of leaving him was...</i>

70
00:05:02.093 --> 00:05:03.011
what did you say

71
00:05:05.972 --> 00:05:07.056
i think

72
00:05:07.932 --> 00:05:08.850
we should go our separate ways.

73
00:05:22.030 --> 00:05:26.117
<i>It was a feeling,</i>
<i>which I could not convey in words.</i>

74
00:05:30.079 --> 00:05:32.582
<i>How did I fall in love with Song Choo Ah?</i>

75
00:05:39.255 --> 00:05:41.257
I have been watching you for a long time.

76
00:05:41.924 --> 00:05:45.094
why don't you have friends
besides that weirdo Ko Geum?

77
00:05:45.636 --> 00:05:47.638
You study well, you write music

78
00:05:47.722 --> 00:05:50.725
and you're pretty, why aren't you popular?

79
00:05:50.808 --> 00:05:53.436
- I am popular at the beginning of the year.
- That is?

80
00:05:53.519 --> 00:05:55.855
As soon as I speak, they understand that I am a fool.

81
00:05:55.938 --> 00:05:57.648
You cast a shadow. step away

82
00:06:03.071 --> 00:06:03.988
what are you doing

83
00:06:05.031 --> 00:06:05.865
You are wrong.

84
00:06:05.948 --> 00:06:07.784
step away what do you want

85
00:06:07.867 --> 00:06:11.829
From now on believe only those
who looks you in the eye when he talks.

86
00:06:15.625 --> 00:06:18.211
<i>Why did I fall in love with such a bright person...</i>

87
00:06:19.420 --> 00:06:21.172
I think you are very cool.

88
00:06:23.007 --> 00:06:25.426
<i>…and let her change my life?</i>

89
00:06:28.930 --> 00:06:32.016
I didn't write a single sentence
in three hours.

90
00:06:32.600 --> 00:06:33.851
In five hours.

91
00:06:33.935 --> 00:06:35.436
Indifferently. i want to sleep

92
00:06:36.270 --> 00:06:38.606
I will not be able to be a writer.

93
00:06:40.400 --> 00:06:43.486
Where to get inspiration?

94
00:06:44.654 --> 00:06:48.324
Lucky you, Honsey.
You have so many songs in your head.

95
00:06:49.492 --> 00:06:50.326
I'm jealous

96
00:06:51.202 --> 00:06:56.040
<i>When they believe in you and love you with all their heart -</i>
<i>it is very powerful.</i>

97
00:07:22.775 --> 00:07:25.194
<i>And I wanted to become even better,</i>

98
00:07:26.237 --> 00:07:29.490
<i>so that the sparkle in her eyes was only for me.</i>

99
00:07:37.790 --> 00:07:40.251
<i>I'm sorry. Apparently, they decided to take another song.</i>

100
00:07:40.751 --> 00:07:42.420
<i>Let's do it another time.</i>

101
00:07:45.923 --> 00:07:47.008
And you are early.

102
00:07:49.802 --> 00:07:51.971
My laptop is so heavy.

103
00:07:52.889 --> 00:07:55.725
The fact that I drag him
won't help me write.

104
00:07:56.309 --> 00:07:57.643
The hand hurts.

105
00:07:57.727 --> 00:07:59.645
Creative work is not easy.

106
00:08:00.980 --> 00:08:03.816
But you're holding up well.
I'm proud of you, Sonchu.

107
00:08:06.152 --> 00:08:08.738
Don't you dare abandon me when you become famous.

108
00:08:09.530 --> 00:08:11.032
You will provide for me.

109
00:08:12.742 --> 00:08:14.118
Of course.

110
00:08:14.202 --> 00:08:17.330
Who else will provide for you, if not me?

111
00:08:20.208 --> 00:08:21.292
That's right.

112
00:08:22.543 --> 00:08:23.503
God

113
00:08:29.759 --> 00:08:30.927
Oho.

114
00:08:32.011 --> 00:08:33.346
Did you stay up all night?

115
00:08:34.347 --> 00:08:35.681
Is that what you do?

116
00:08:35.765 --> 00:08:38.017
- Get up. what are you doing
- What are you?

117
00:08:38.100 --> 00:08:40.770
Don't touch my things and go away.

118
00:08:40.853 --> 00:08:42.355
These are advertising jingles.

119
00:08:42.438 --> 00:08:46.400
You said you don't do it for the money
and now you write jingles?

120
00:08:46.484 --> 00:08:49.362
- And what? I need a lot of money.
- Why?

121
00:08:50.071 --> 00:08:53.908
Did you buy game items?
How did you get so strong so quickly?

122
00:08:54.825 --> 00:08:56.077
Shut up.

123
00:08:56.577 --> 00:08:59.288
I have to provide for Chu Ah
as a responsible person.

124
00:08:59.372 --> 00:09:00.957
And what about me?

125
00:09:01.499 --> 00:09:03.584
Provide for me as a responsible person.

126
00:09:03.668 --> 00:09:04.919
Go away!

127
00:09:05.461 --> 00:09:08.130
you are funny What's wrong with you all of a sudden?

128
00:09:08.714 --> 00:09:10.466
Will you marry her?

129
00:09:10.550 --> 00:09:11.801
Yes, indeed.

130
00:09:11.884 --> 00:09:13.761
Really? When?

131
00:09:15.846 --> 00:09:17.306
I can even tomorrow.

132
00:09:17.932 --> 00:09:19.267
Congratulations.

133
00:09:19.350 --> 00:09:21.686
Recommend a laptop for writers.

134
00:09:21.769 --> 00:09:24.021
Is it light? How much memory?

135
00:09:24.105 --> 00:09:26.023
Is this one suitable?

136
00:09:26.107 --> 00:09:28.442
This is a good laptop. Want to try it?

137
00:09:30.027 --> 00:09:31.737
I'll be back with a girl.

138
00:09:32.321 --> 00:09:34.991
This is a gift and I want her to like it.

139
00:09:36.200 --> 00:09:37.660
Today is our seventh anniversary.

140
00:09:38.160 --> 00:09:40.788
she is a writer
writes scripts for films.

141
00:09:42.498 --> 00:09:43.332
Cool, right?

142
00:09:45.543 --> 00:09:46.460
<i>But then...</i>

143
00:10:14.780 --> 00:10:17.867
<i>with the same eyes and lips,</i>
<i>how she praised me,</i>

144
00:10:18.367 --> 00:10:19.827
<i>she said about the breakup.</i>

145
00:10:21.287 --> 00:10:23.623
<i>Hardly there is anything more cruel.</i>

146
00:10:46.020 --> 00:10:49.231
<i>I'm miserable,</i>
<i>because he talked a lot and achieved nothing?</i>

147
00:10:51.609 --> 00:10:55.488
<i>She's tired of my music,</i>
<i>which she, according to her, once loved?</i>

148
00:10:57.156 --> 00:10:59.033
<i>Didn't she see a future in me?</i>

149
00:11:14.757 --> 00:11:15.675
<i>I...</i>

150
00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:19.387
<i>turned into a loser?</i>

151
00:11:42.451 --> 00:11:47.206
<i>But when the memories faded,</i>
<i>and pain became a regular companion...</i>

152
00:11:47.707 --> 00:11:49.041
I wrote about us.

153
00:11:49.125 --> 00:11:50.292
What did you write?

154
00:11:50.376 --> 00:11:53.713
As you said, I was desperate
and drew inspiration everywhere.

155
00:11:54.338 --> 00:11:55.464
I wrote about us.

156
00:11:57.508 --> 00:12:01.762
I want to make a movie, but I need you.

157
00:12:03.305 --> 00:12:07.476
<i>…she appeared again</i>
<i>with some ridiculous excuse.</i>

158
00:12:14.942 --> 00:12:16.277
what are you doing

159
00:12:16.944 --> 00:12:18.320
<i>And I began to think.</i>

160
00:12:18.404 --> 00:12:22.283
Isn't that what guys want?
from ex-girlfriends?

161
00:12:23.576 --> 00:12:25.161
<i>"Maybe break her heart?"</i>

162
00:12:30.207 --> 00:12:32.209
<i>To make a confession,</i>
<i>why did she come back?”</i>

163
00:12:32.710 --> 00:12:34.712
This is so stupid.

164
00:12:35.838 --> 00:12:37.757
That's how I showed my feelings.

165
00:12:39.008 --> 00:12:41.927
I wanted to do everything your way.

166
00:12:42.428 --> 00:12:44.680
Then I loved you so much

167
00:12:45.389 --> 00:12:47.475
that she behaved pathetically, but she didn't have to.

168
00:12:48.642 --> 00:12:50.269
<i>But the funniest thing...</i>

169
00:12:50.352 --> 00:12:53.147
There is nothing left. Isn't that right?

170
00:12:54.940 --> 00:12:57.276
Do you want me to say yes or no?

171
00:12:58.861 --> 00:13:02.198
<i>…I have hope,</i>
<i>that we still have a chance.</i>

172
00:13:24.094 --> 00:13:26.388
<i>It was a feeling,</i>
<i>which I could not convey in words.</i>

173
00:13:32.228 --> 00:13:33.103
Chu A.

174
00:13:33.813 --> 00:13:34.647
What?

175
00:13:34.730 --> 00:13:36.732
Everything between us? Do we…

176
00:13:40.152 --> 00:13:41.987
on the way back to each other?

177
00:13:46.408 --> 00:13:49.161
<i>When it is difficult to answer,</i>
<i>there is only one option.</i>

178
00:13:51.330 --> 00:13:53.666
Looks like we need to talk.

179
00:13:53.749 --> 00:13:54.750
Song Choo A.

180
00:13:57.127 --> 00:13:59.755
Sometimes I missed you a lot.

181
00:14:01.423 --> 00:14:05.261
I was wondering whether to take revenge on you
or come up and hug.

182
00:14:05.344 --> 00:14:09.265
I've been thinking about you so much that I didn't expect
that something will catch me by surprise.

183
00:14:11.433 --> 00:14:12.518
But I…

184
00:14:17.898 --> 00:14:20.150
I still get excited when I see you.

185
00:14:20.734 --> 00:14:21.569
Si Chun.

186
00:14:21.652 --> 00:14:23.320
I thought I wouldn't talk about it

187
00:14:23.404 --> 00:14:25.906
but seeing your smile

188
00:14:25.990 --> 00:14:28.409
wanted to try one last time.

189
00:14:37.459 --> 00:14:38.836
How about three dates?

190
00:14:40.921 --> 00:14:43.924
Come on a date with me, Chu A.

191
00:14:59.106 --> 00:15:00.608
EPISODE 9

192
00:15:00.691 --> 00:15:07.615
WE WERE LIKE STRANGERS
WHO KNOW EACH OTHER WELL

193
00:16:30.197 --> 00:16:31.198
are you awake

194
00:16:40.833 --> 00:16:41.834
Definitely not sleeping.

195
00:16:47.131 --> 00:16:48.465
Yes, I don't sleep!

196
00:16:51.927 --> 00:16:54.263
It's time to get up.

197
00:16:55.889 --> 00:16:57.057
Oh well.

198
00:16:57.141 --> 00:16:58.308
Quietly.

199
00:16:58.392 --> 00:17:01.395
You don't have to do that in bed.

200
00:17:03.188 --> 00:17:05.357
When did you even get here?

201
00:17:08.402 --> 00:17:09.570
And if not in bed?

202
00:17:26.795 --> 00:17:29.256
I didn't ask you to move.

203
00:17:34.470 --> 00:17:38.057
Maybe stay here forever?

204
00:17:39.683 --> 00:17:40.517
What?

205
00:17:47.191 --> 00:17:48.192
Amazingly.

206
00:17:49.151 --> 00:17:50.652
It excited me.

207
00:17:52.154 --> 00:17:56.575
Does she even know what she's talking about?

208
00:18:04.249 --> 00:18:07.169
- How long will you be at work?
- I don't know.

209
00:18:07.795 --> 00:18:11.215
The producer insisted
that will come to the office, and it will take time.

210
00:18:11.298 --> 00:18:13.842
Why does she bother you on the day off?

211
00:18:15.260 --> 00:18:17.679
Happy to be at home while I'm gone.

212
00:18:17.763 --> 00:18:18.764
OK.

213
00:18:20.099 --> 00:18:23.685
what you said before

214
00:18:24.353 --> 00:18:26.021
what did you mean

215
00:18:26.105 --> 00:18:27.106
That is?

216
00:18:27.189 --> 00:18:29.858
you talked about
to stay here forever.

217
00:18:31.318 --> 00:18:32.402
That's what she meant.

218
00:18:32.486 --> 00:18:34.238
- Really?
- Yes.

219
00:18:34.738 --> 00:18:37.825
If mom doesn't catch it, why not?

220
00:19:05.394 --> 00:19:08.647
Don't worry. She likes me.

221
00:19:08.730 --> 00:19:10.524
Now she will hate you.

222
00:19:11.233 --> 00:19:13.235
bye Don't wait for me.

223
00:19:13.735 --> 00:19:16.071
Maybe I won't come today.

224
00:19:17.281 --> 00:19:18.782
OK. Have a nice day.

225
00:20:11.043 --> 00:20:14.463
Not too casual?
Maybe you should have worn a skirt.

226
00:20:55.420 --> 00:20:56.421
Greetings.

227
00:21:04.054 --> 00:21:04.888
Come on.

228
00:21:05.889 --> 00:21:07.808
Why did you take me for…

229
00:21:08.684 --> 00:21:10.185
You can let go.

230
00:21:10.936 --> 00:21:12.854
I'm hungry Let's eat first.

231
00:21:12.938 --> 00:21:13.939
Good.

232
00:21:45.470 --> 00:21:47.639
I don't know where to start.

233
00:21:48.140 --> 00:21:51.810
The budget was immediately small.

234
00:21:51.893 --> 00:21:55.314
And now the investor asked
further cut costs,

235
00:21:55.397 --> 00:21:58.817
and I said we can't
continue production.

236
00:22:00.569 --> 00:22:02.446
As a result

237
00:22:03.071 --> 00:22:05.198
they refused to finance the project.

238
00:23:53.932 --> 00:23:56.184
Lord! what are you doing here

239
00:23:56.268 --> 00:23:57.686
Are you throwing it all away?

240
00:24:00.897 --> 00:24:01.857
Yes.

241
00:24:02.774 --> 00:24:05.944
But the chair is still intact.
And it was Chun's favorite chair.

242
00:24:07.362 --> 00:24:08.447
why did you come

243
00:24:08.530 --> 00:24:11.199
It's not nice to say that
we haven't seen each other for a long time.

244
00:24:18.832 --> 00:24:20.208
I'm glad you're here.

245
00:24:22.794 --> 00:24:25.130
I have a lot to throw away, can you help me?

246
00:24:26.590 --> 00:24:28.008
Why are you suddenly throwing everything away?

247
00:24:29.050 --> 00:24:30.051
Just like that.

248
00:24:30.719 --> 00:24:33.805
Time to clean the house
and get rid of some things.

249
00:24:36.850 --> 00:24:38.435
And what?

250
00:24:39.060 --> 00:24:40.145
Nothing.

251
00:24:40.228 --> 00:24:43.648
You didn't even throw away the old box,
and he returned it to me.

252
00:24:43.732 --> 00:24:47.152
You can't get rid of it
old comics and tapes,

253
00:24:48.320 --> 00:24:50.989
so it's weird to see you throw something away.

254
00:24:51.740 --> 00:24:54.826
I had to get rid of them sometime.

255
00:24:56.077 --> 00:24:56.995
Gomme.

256
00:24:58.914 --> 00:25:00.248
Give yourself time.

257
00:25:03.460 --> 00:25:05.587
Don't be in such a hurry.

258
