He came and spent time with me,
like I'm some kind of homework.

356
00:33:10.363 --> 00:33:12.490
I'm not stupid enough not to notice it.

357
00:33:12.573 --> 00:33:13.408
Mubi.

358
00:33:13.491 --> 00:33:15.618
I hate that name. It is so…

