386
00:35:25.540 --> 00:35:27.291
You too live the way you want.

387
00:35:34.674 --> 00:35:35.842
Damn know-it-all.

388
00:35:37.885 --> 00:35:39.929
I can't cry with you.

389
00:35:43.850 --> 00:35:46.102
But he is able to give you a rivet.

