Where did she go so early?

412
00:38:51.704 --> 00:38:54.790
So you say that you came just like that?

413
00:38:55.583 --> 00:38:56.417
Ugh.

414
00:38:57.710 --> 00:39:01.964
And we are so close
to meet so early?

415
00:39:02.048 --> 00:39:04.633
We used to
spent all nights together.

416
00:39:04.717 --> 00:39:06.385
So what's wrong?

417
00:39:06.469 --> 00:39:08.220
I think you are right.

418
00:39:09.013 --> 00:39:13.100
why did you come
Discuss Golem behind his back?

419
00:39:14.185 --> 00:39:15.853
