I informed the staff this morning.
It was strange going to the office.

431
00:39:46.550 --> 00:39:48.219
And I didn't know where to turn.

432
00:39:49.303 --> 00:39:52.807
I wonder what you do to pass the time?

433
00:39:52.890 --> 00:39:57.228
The producers decided
cancel the project due to lack of investment,

434
00:39:57.311 --> 00:39:59.230
and you just agreed?

435
00:39:59.730 --> 00:40:00.731
Yes.

436
00:40:09.240 --> 00:40:13.035
What do you want to hear from me?
Did you make the right choice?

437
00:40:13.119 --> 00:40:14.954
You made the same choice.

438
00:40:15.037 --> 00:40:18.165
Of course. They said there is no money
so I canceled the project.

439
00:40:18.249 --> 00:40:20.709
That's right. I did that too.

440
00:40:20.793 --> 00:40:22.503
And that's right.

441
00:40:22.586 --> 00:40:24.255
But are we the same?

442
00:40:25.297 --> 00:40:27.716
I have made 12 feature films

443
00:40:27.800 --> 00:40:30.469
