that your project was canceled, but...

446
00:40:39.270 --> 00:40:41.355
No, just the opposite.

447
00:40:42.189 --> 00:40:44.108
Director Kim, I was told:

448
00:40:44.191 --> 00:40:47.445
“I'm sorry, Director Ma.
We don't have money for the film."

449
00:40:47.945 --> 00:40:51.615
Then I said, "To hell with it."
And waited for the next opportunity.

450
00:40:52.408 --> 00:40:56.162
I don't mind sharing later
its history Not a problem.

451
00:40:56.245 --> 00:40:58.914
But for young people, everything is different.

452
00:41:00.499 --> 00:41:03.836
If you don't tell
your story now, it will disappear.

453
00:41:05.629 --> 00:41:07.882
Some stories need to be told right away.

454
00:41:07.965 --> 00:41:11.677
