462
00:41:35.159 --> 00:41:36.410
Amazingly.

463
00:41:36.952 --> 00:41:39.663
Many people had to leave this job,

464
00:41:39.747 --> 00:41:42.416
but no one stayed against his will.

465
00:41:45.085 --> 00:41:46.420
Time for you to decide.

466
00:41:47.546 --> 00:41:48.464
Kim Mubi.

467
00:41:49.423 --> 00:41:52.009
I don't know how you ended up in this industry

468
00:41:53.093 --> 00:41:54.428
but whatever...

469
00:41:56.096 --> 00:41:57.515
it was your choice.

470
00:42:10.027 --> 00:42:11.695
Why doesn't he answer?

471
00:42:14.031 --> 00:42:15.115
Where are you?

472
00:42:16.534 --> 00:42:18.452
Why didn't you pick up the phone?

473
00:42:19.578 --> 00:42:20.913
Turned off the sound.

474
00:42:21.622 --> 00:42:23.541
Have you heard about our film?

475
00:42:24.124 --> 00:42:25.543
Yes, I heard.

476
00:42:25.626 --> 00:42:28.462
I don't understand why so suddenly

477
00:42:28.546 --> 00:42:32.091
but it's not official yet
so there must be a way to solve everything.

478
00:42:32.174 --> 00:42:33.592
Is that why you came?

479
00:42:35.844 --> 00:42:36.679
are you ok

480
00:42:38.430 --> 00:42:39.932
Yes...

481
00:42:41.058 --> 00:42:43.060
I'm used to the fact that not everything works out.

482
00:42:45.020 --> 00:42:46.647
Everything was too good to be true.

483
00:42:47.189 --> 00:42:50.276
Let's talk to the producers.
We just need an investor.

484
00:42:50.359 --> 00:42:53.612
Or public funding.
The budget is small...

485
00:42:53.696 --> 00:42:54.530
Of course.

486
00:43:00.077 --> 00:43:00.995
Let it be...

487
00:43:02.746 --> 00:43:03.747
shall we go

488
00:43:04.999 --> 00:43:06.083
Second date.

489
00:43:06.667 --> 00:43:07.501
What?

490
00:43:07.585 --> 00:43:10.838
I don't want to think about anything else.

491
00:43:19.847 --> 00:43:20.889
Such

492
