524
00:46:30.913 --> 00:46:33.373
Kim Mubi's own fault
who missed this masterpiece.

525
00:46:34.124 --> 00:46:36.752
Indifferently. We will find a way
make this movie.

526
00:46:41.298 --> 00:46:43.050
Shall we talk about something else?

527
00:46:43.550 --> 00:46:45.803
Just don't say you gave up.

528
00:46:46.804 --> 00:46:48.555
Don't worry. I will take care of…

529
00:46:48.639 --> 00:46:49.807
No need.

530
00:46:54.728 --> 00:46:56.563
I will quit everything.

531
00:46:58.690 --> 00:47:00.943
What? What will you throw?

532
00:47:03.403 --> 00:47:04.321
Music

533
00:47:06.698 --> 00:47:07.533
What?

534
00:47:07.616 --> 00:47:09.535
I held on too long.

535
00:47:09.618 --> 00:47:12.204
It is a shame to pretend that I am capable of this.

536
00:47:14.039 --> 00:47:15.207
And above all...

537
00:47:21.171 --> 00:47:23.090
i am tired

538
00:47:26.718 --> 00:47:27.678
You can't throw.

539
00:47:30.806 --> 00:47:31.974
Why not?

540
00:47:33.851 --> 00:47:36.270
- Can't I give up?
- No.

541
00:47:36.353 --> 00:47:37.938
To such a talent like you...

542
00:47:38.021 --> 00:47:39.439
Stop it!

543
00:47:42.067 --> 00:47:45.654
Because of your attitude
I act like a fool.

544
00:47:46.363 --> 00:47:49.533
Needless to say, I'm talented.
I don't want to hear that.

545
00:47:50.200 --> 00:47:53.579
Why do you give me hope?
and make you forget your place?

546
00:47:53.662 --> 00:47:55.873
Why do you keep interfering?

547
00:48:19.354 --> 00:48:20.188
Devil.

548
00:49:21.041 --> 00:49:22.876
{\an8}MELODY

549
00:49:31.426 --> 00:49:33.637
<i>Some stories need to be told right away.</i>

550
00:49:33.720 --> 00:49:36.515
<i>And you really want to</i>
<i>tell your story, right?</i>

551
00:49:39.977 --> 00:49:40.811
Dad

552
00:49:41.478 --> 00:49:44.356
Why do you want to make a movie so much?

553
00:49:45.565 --> 00:49:49.403
Because there is a story I want to tell.

554
00:49:50.821 --> 00:49:52.155
What is the story?

555
00:51:07.314 --> 00:51:08.231
Of course.

556
00:51:08.899 --> 00:51:10.150
There is no lighter.

557
00:51:13.236 --> 00:51:15.489
I don't think you can help me.

558
00:51:33.090 --> 00:51:35.675
I went all over the neighborhood looking for you.

559
00:51:36.927 --> 00:51:37.761
Really?

560
00:51:37.844 --> 00:51:39.679
No, I found you right away.

561
00:51:40.514 --> 00:51:41.932
And why were you looking for me?

562
00:51:42.724 --> 00:51:44.059
You said

563
00:51:44.142 --> 00:51:46.978
what do you ask for when you need help?

564
00:51:47.854 --> 00:51:50.857
I have to be there
to hear you ask.

565
00:51:52.984 --> 00:51:54.486
You said

566
00:51:55.862 --> 00:51:58.448
what do you ask for when you need help?

567
00:51:59.241 --> 00:52:02.160
I have to be there
to hear you ask.

568
00:52:17.509 --> 00:52:18.343
Come here.

569
00:52:41.992 --> 00:52:43.076
Come on?

570
00:52:44.619 --> 00:52:45.620
give me

571
00:52:59.050 --> 00:53:06.057
VIDE BAR

572
00:53:15.275 --> 00:53:16.359
dear god

573
00:53:28.955 --> 00:53:29.873
Song Choo Ah!

574
00:53:32.709 --> 00:53:33.960
You are a real idiot!

575
00:53:34.836 --> 00:53:36.421
Self-centered as always.

576
00:53:36.504 --> 00:53:40.091
You think I'm joking
supported you all the time?

577
00:53:40.800 --> 00:53:42.719
Did I interfere in your affairs?

578
00:53:42.802 --> 00:53:46.223
And I have no right after all the shit
what have I experienced in seven years?

579
00:53:46.306 --> 00:53:47.307
I didn't ask you to.

580
00:53:48.225 --> 00:53:50.977
I was suffocating
because you put your hopes in me.

581
00:53:51.061 --> 00:53:54.648
You admired my songs.
It was driving me crazy!

582
00:53:54.731 --> 00:53:56.816
Because of you, I couldn't give up everything.

583
00:53:56.900 --> 00:53:59.527
How dare you talk about my love like that?

584
00:54:01.071 --> 00:54:04.741
Did you suffocate? It was wrong
wish you the best?

585
00:54:04.824 --> 00:54:06.993
I don't care what happens

586
00:54:07.077 --> 00:54:09.829
but for you I'm poor
which should be saved.

587
00:54:09.913 --> 00:54:12.791
I just wanted to go on a date with you

588
00:54:13.375 --> 00:54:15.794
and you make me feel like a loser.

589
00:54:17.337 --> 00:54:20.840
Good. It's more like it
on the Xi Chun I know.

590
00:54:21.967 --> 00:54:23.385
You always blame me.

591
00:54:23.468 --> 00:54:27.055
It's my fault we broke up
and you didn't succeed?

592
00:54:27.138 --> 00:54:29.849
Why then did we break up?
You left me!

593
00:54:29.933 --> 00:54:31.309
Because you are selfish.

594
00:54:32.185 --> 00:54:35.438
you are so selfish
that you don't deserve to have someone by your side.

595
00:54:36.690 --> 00:54:39.317
You are indifferent to my feelings or thoughts.

596
00:54:39.401 --> 00:54:41.444
You only care about yourself.

597
00:54:42.195 --> 00:54:44.781
You ignore me when I'm around!

598
00:54:45.282 --> 00:54:49.536
I always just wanted to be with you.

599
00:54:50.370 --> 00:54:51.955
Am I asking too much?

600
00:54:52.038 --> 00:54:53.873
Was it selfish?

601
00:54:54.374 --> 00:54:57.043
It was you who left me
and returned from a whim!

602
00:54:59.713 --> 00:55:02.632
Why did you come back and give me hope?

603
00:55:06.011 --> 00:55:08.972
You made it difficult
saying you are still worried.

604
00:55:10.265 --> 00:55:12.100
You don't need what I've become.

605
00:55:12.183 --> 00:55:15.020
You're still looking for the Song Chu Ah you knew back then.

606
00:55:25.822 --> 00:55:28.783
Cause I'm still trapped in that day
when you left me

607
00:55:34.039 --> 00:55:36.082
Everything I want is in the past

608
00:55:37.500 --> 00:55:39.336
so who cares about the future?

609
00:55:51.598 --> 00:55:56.353
<i>Sometimes it's bad to know each other so well.</i>

610
00:55:59.189 --> 00:56:01.900
<i>Such a relationship can</i>
<i>to give great love,</i>

611
00:56:01.983 --> 00:56:04.861
<i>and can cause great pain.</i>

612
00:56:14.579 --> 00:56:15.580
<i>And...</i>

613
00:56:25.715 --> 00:56:30.053
<i>you clearly feel that the end is near.</i>

614
00:56:58.289 --> 00:57:03.628
<i>I don't think I'll ever understand Ko Gyum.</i>

615
00:57:04.629 --> 00:57:08.049
And you don't have to worry about me
that my movie was cancelled?

616
00:57:09.050 --> 00:57:12.387
I don't know.
I'm sure Kim Mubi will be fine.

617
00:57:12.971 --> 00:57:13.805
Why?

618
00:57:14.681 --> 00:57:16.015
You will do it anyway.

619
00:57:16.766 --> 00:57:18.017
Do you think?

620
00:57:19.853 --> 00:57:22.272
You said you would shoot a good melodrama.

621
00:57:32.824 --> 00:57:36.494
But why melodrama?

622
00:57:41.624 --> 00:57:42.542
I'm just

623
00:57:43.710 --> 00:57:46.129
I wanted to tell the sweetest story.

624
00:57:47.505 --> 00:57:50.008
A story about people
who love each other.

625
00:58:00.810 --> 00:58:02.061
I just wanted

626
00:58:03.396 --> 00:58:05.565
to be loved

627
00:58:11.112 --> 00:58:13.281
<i>And I felt that...</i>

628
00:58:14.324 --> 00:58:17.118
If I tell a secret
will you still like me

629
00:58:18.411 --> 00:58:19.746
Won't you leave me?

630
00:58:26.127 --> 00:58:28.796
<i>…I want to share everything with him.</i>

631
00:58:42.602 --> 00:58:44.771
I think dad died because of me.

632
00:59:01.913 --> 00:59:07.585
LIKE IN THE MOVIE

633
00:59:15.051 --> 00:59:18.471
<i>Goem, what is your secret?</i>

634
00:59:22.308 --> 00:59:23.726
<i>My secret?</i>

635
00:59:28.147 --> 00:59:29.148
<i>Well…</i>

636
01:01:36.484 --> 01:01:40.196
Translation of subtitles: Natalya Kovalyshyn

